{"id":"n74124-3-6","stage":1,"title":"뛰다 · 逃跑","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74124-3-6-1","ko":"이 도둑놈들, 거기 서라!","zh":"你们这些小偷，站住！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도둑놈들,","meaning":"贼，小偷","explanation":"도둑놈：贼，小偷；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"도둑놈","audio":"/audio/a205ef73aba1217e68e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47816","senseId":"1","lemma":"도둑놈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거기","meaning":"那儿，那边，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那边，那里","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"1","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서라!","meaning":"站，站立","explanation":"서다：站，站立；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"1","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a205ef73aba1217e","term":"도둑놈","zh":"贼，小偷","audio":"/audio/a205ef73aba1217e68e7.mp3","entryId":"47816","definition":"(贬称)偷东西的人。","pronunciation":["도둥놈"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那边，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代与听话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"站，站立","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"人或动物把脚放在地上，使身体挺直。","pronunciation":["서다"]}],"audio":"/audio/937f232c00acb037e630.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74124-3-6-2","ko":"경찰이다! 얘들아, 어서 뛰어!","zh":"是警察！大家快跑！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경찰이다!","meaning":"警察","explanation":"경찰：警察；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"2","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얘들아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"얘：喂；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"얘","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67257","senseId":"2","lemma":"얘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰어!","meaning":"逃跑，逃窜，逃亡","explanation":"뛰다：逃跑，逃窜，逃亡；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뛰다","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74124","senseId":"3","lemma":"뛰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"642315305ad78197","term":"경찰","zh":"警察","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3","entryId":"25949","definition":"负责维持社会秩序、保护人民生命和财产安全的公务员。","pronunciation":["경ː찰"]},{"id":"1ad358ceb1fa5d83","term":"얘","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3","entryId":"67257","definition":"大人叫孩子时，或者年龄相等的人之间招呼时用的词语。","pronunciation":["얘ː"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"96e5ecf6b0d33341","term":"뛰다","zh":"逃跑，逃窜，逃亡","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3","entryId":"74124","definition":"(粗俗)逃走。","pronunciation":["뛰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b263f4d4df306869449.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.191,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74124","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5698,"ques